<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.1//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml11/DTD/xhtml11.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="ko"><head><title>현재 화면이 팝업인지 확인하기</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="css/book.css" type="text/css" /><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="application/xhtml+xml; charset=utf-8" /><meta name="EPB-UUID" content="f1fbcef72ff0a2ec" /></head><body><div class="chapter_content"><h1 id="r_cb434d876b3f16c9" class="chapter_title">현재 화면이 팝업인지 확인하기</h1><h1 id="r_c0b9244b7a361a36" class="element heading1" data-element-id="c0b9244b7a361a36"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">1</span><span>개요</span></div></h1><pre id="r_8a5549394dd3ec00" class="element pre" data-element-id="8a5549394dd3ec00">'$p.isPopup' 메소드와 '$p.isWFramePopup' 메소드를 사용하여 현재 화면이 팝업인지를 확인하는 예제입니다. '현재 화면'이란 메소드를 호출하는 스크립트가 작성된 화면을 의미합니다.</pre><div id="r_64aa5da8c3cdbd6a" class="element caution" data-element-id="64aa5da8c3cdbd6a"><p>'$p.isPopup' 메소드와 '$p.isWFramePopup' 메소드는 팝업의 유형이 'wframePopup' 또는 'browserPopup'인 경우에만 지원됩니다.</p></div><p id="r_583b0b1d2a430e39" class="element r_example_link_p" data-element-id="583b0b1d2a430e39"><a class="link" href="http://example.websquare.kr/link.html?p=P00055">P00055</a></p><h1 id="r_f7d82f861b216f44" class="element heading1" data-element-id="f7d82f861b216f44"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">2</span><span>구현된 기능</span></div></h1><ul id="r_eac970da8deaff3b" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="eac970da8deaff3b"><li><p>팝업이 아닌 화면에서 $p.isPopup, $p.isWFramePopup 실행하기</p></li><li><p>Browser PopUp 에서 $p.isPopup, $p.isWFramePopup 실행하기</p></li><li><p>WFrame PopUp 에서 $p.isPopup, $p.isWFramePopup 실행하기</p></li></ul><h1 id="r_791d4516eaa47035" class="element heading1" data-element-id="791d4516eaa47035"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">3</span><span>예제 테스트 방법</span></div></h1><p id="r_ee7f55265e364213" class="element normal" data-element-id="ee7f55265e364213">예제의 테스트 방법은 버튼을 클릭하여 결과값을 확인하는 방식으로 구성되었습니다.</p><h2 id="r_15b2703ea70c97a6" class="element heading2" data-element-id="15b2703ea70c97a6"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.1</span><span>Browser PopUp 호출하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_2486b33a25aa5610" class="element step1" data-element-id="2486b33a25aa5610"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">$p.openPopup() - browserPopup 실행</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><p id="r_071ddd4ce8cd0f51" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="071ddd4ce8cd0f51">Browser 팝업이 호출됩니다.</p><div id="r_87f6641b89a96574" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="87f6641b89a96574"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 1.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image010.png" width="452" height="466" /></p></div><h2 id="r_68a3de9ccccf7368" class="element heading2" data-element-id="68a3de9ccccf7368"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.2</span><span>WFrame PopUp 호출하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_b7606e5729996bee" class="element step1" data-element-id="b7606e5729996bee"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">$p.openPopup() - wframePopup 실행</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><p id="r_3218bb6478460377" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="3218bb6478460377">WFrame 팝업이 호출됩니다.</p><div id="r_04d37ec84521b7a1" class="element image step1_indent" data-element-id="04d37ec84521b7a1"><p class="caption"><span class="image_caption_n">Image 2.</span>브라우저(Chrome) 실행 예시</p><p class="content"><img alt="" src="images/image011.png" width="448" height="397" /></p></div><h2 id="r_e54d09925b035064" class="element heading2" data-element-id="e54d09925b035064"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">3.3</span><span>현재 화면이 팝업인지 확인하기</span></div></h2><div id="r_6c5c8fe9fa6754f5" class="element step1" data-element-id="6c5c8fe9fa6754f5"><p class="step1_n">1</p><p>STEP 1: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">$p.isPopup() 실행</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><p id="r_c37cab2c983369ce" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="c37cab2c983369ce">메소드를 호출한 화면이 팝업인지 여부와 예상 실행 결과를 alert합니다.</p><div id="r_239c6b44d6828887" class="element step1" data-element-id="239c6b44d6828887"><p class="step1_n">2</p><p>STEP 2: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">$p.isPopup(true) 실행</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><p id="r_a7bf2d580697c70d" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="a7bf2d580697c70d">메소드를 호출한 화면이 팝업에 속한 화면인지 여부와 예상 실행 결과를 alert합니다.</p><div id="r_0225c07f7cf59c4f" class="element step1" data-element-id="0225c07f7cf59c4f"><p class="step1_n">3</p><p>STEP 3: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">$p.isWFramePopup() 실행</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><p id="r_6b6f783ea2a3ce66" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="6b6f783ea2a3ce66">메소드를 호출한 화면이 WFrame 팝업인지 여부와 예상 실행 결과를 alert합니다.</p><div id="r_cef726cdd90649aa" class="element step1" data-element-id="cef726cdd90649aa"><p class="step1_n">4</p><p>STEP 4: '<span class="r_exec_btn_style_span">$p.isWFramePopup(true) 실행</span>' 버튼을 클릭합니다.</p></div><p id="r_78e6c321388df03c" class="element normal step1_indent" data-element-id="78e6c321388df03c">메소드를 호출한 화면이 WFrame 팝업에 속한 화면인지 여부와 예상 실행 결과를 alert합니다.</p><h1 id="r_ff1a94b16b1c9674" class="element heading1" data-element-id="ff1a94b16b1c9674"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">4</span><span>구현 예시</span></div></h1><h2 id="r_07c52f615b738148" class="element heading2" data-element-id="07c52f615b738148"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.1</span><span>$p.isPopup</span></div></h2><div id="r_ae5d33bf0db4ac7b" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="ae5d33bf0db4ac7b"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 1.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//case 1</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//이 스크립트를 호출한 화면이 팝업인지의 여부를 반환합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> ispopup = $p.isPopup();
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//case 2</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//이 스크립트를 호출한 화면이 팝업에 속한 화면인지 여부를 반환합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> ispopup = $p.isPopup(<span class="r_h_keyword_span">true</span>);</pre></div><h2 id="r_25929a4dc3b3a0c9" class="element heading2" data-element-id="25929a4dc3b3a0c9"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading2_n">4.2</span><span>$p.isWFramePopup</span></div></h2><div id="r_e73f94832a1e093b" class="element code support_code_numbering" data-element-id="e73f94832a1e093b"><p class="caption"><span class="code_caption_n">Example 2.</span>Script</p><pre><span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//case 1</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//이 스크립트를 호출한 화면이 WFrame 팝업인지의 여부를 반환합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> ispopup = $p.isWFramePopup();
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//case 2</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_comment_span">//이 스크립트를 호출한 화면이 WFrame 팝업에 속한 화면인지 여부를 반환합니다.</span>
<span class="digits_1 code_line"></span><span class="r_h_keyword_span">var</span> ispopup = $p.isWFramePopup(<span class="r_h_keyword_span">true</span>);</pre></div><h1 id="r_67e7ccb630cebe84" class="element heading1" data-element-id="67e7ccb630cebe84"><div class="r_heading_inner"><span class="heading1_n">5</span><span>주요 API</span></div></h1><ul id="r_9c8b3009065e4b18" class="element unordered_list" data-element-id="9c8b3009065e4b18"><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">$p.isPopup( closest )</span></p></li><li><p><span class="r_ex_api_method_span">$p.isWFramePopup( closest )</span></p></li></ul></div></body></html>